comment = "5BSD kernel module manager service"

desc = <<EOD
kldmgrd is a libservice-based privileged service that brokers controlled
kernel module load, unload, and list operations for capability-managed
systems.  It is installed as a system .cap bundle under /Capabilities/System
and requires client labels to be listed in /etc/kldmgrd.allow before serving
requests.
EOD
